  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Remote Adjudication Interview Support to Permanent Resident Applicants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to support the Government of Canada in its capacity to assess candidates situated within Malaysia for permanent residency visas. This includes that IOM will facilitate the virtual interviews as conducted by IRCC Singapore at IOM premises. In coordination with the donor, IOM contacts applicants and provides them with the necessary information as required. IOM&#x2019;s support includes the provision of a private interview space, video conferencing equipment, the screening of applicants and ensuring appropriate public health requirements are implemented to curb the spread of Covid-19.</narrative>
  </description>
